  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 0.1.0-preview.4 - 2026-08-14\n\n- Add the portable validation-package metadata domain.\n- Narrow CWL scalar command-input declarations to required, unique prefixes\n  and deterministic logical argv materialization.\n- Add canonical and read-only legacy validation-packages configuration types,\n  strict scalar values, declaration compatibility, and range validation.\n- Add SemVer precedence and deterministic package-identity ordering.\n- Include Fable sources for .NET, JavaScript, and Python consumers.\n- Build installable npm and Python packages alongside the NuGet package.\n- Publish one versioned artifact set through independently retriable NuGet,\n  npm, and PyPI trusted-publishing jobs.",
